Dear officer,

From April 2027, every company officer with a filing reference will need to complete identity verification once, either online or through an authorised agent. We are running a free 45-minute webinar for officers and company secretaries:

Thursday 12 November 2026, 11:00
Register: marchwoldregistry.org.uk/events/idv-2027

We will cover what documents are accepted, what happens to existing filing references, and how LLPs such as VENNHOLT PARTNERS LLP with several designated members can verify everyone in one sitting.

